  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "rtkyj",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
